Adapted files:
- src/quickshell/reusables/display/LiquidGlass.qml -> qml/components/GlassOptics.qml
- src/assets/shaders/effects/liquid_glass.frag -> qml/components/shaders/liquid-glass.frag
  (including its compiled .qsb artifact)

LME changes: local/theme paths, optional source texture, transparent hybrid body,
bounded wallpaper refraction at the rim, and premultiplied highlight coverage.
LME's clear mode removes the body lift/sheen and narrows/reduces rim refraction
to avoid a gray veil over the live backdrop.
The clear-interior fast path preserves lighting while skipping unused lens math.
Separate LME glass controls adjust rim feather/width, refraction spread, lens
frost and highlights. A premultiplied black veil dims glass in the existing pass;
their neutral defaults retain the previous appearance and rendering lifecycle.
The real application backdrop remains compositor-owned; no live desktop capture
is performed. The surrounding lifecycle/neutral-theme integration is LME code.

